/* xthru combines terms over a common denominator through COMDENOM,
   which gets each term's numerator and denominator factors back from
   PRODND in the specials SN* and SD*.  Each call binds them.  Shared,
   concurrent calls read each other's factors: measured on SBCL, 21 of
   48 parallel xthru(1/(x+i) + 1/(x-i)) were mathematically wrong, e.g.
   (x-1)/(x-2) for i = 2. */
(kill(all), 0);
